close_reason: "Reverified current main ce948522e18a: merged #77 (a8d309b); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Enable pm-github issue sync in the pm-rl tracker.** [PR #77](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/77) (a8d309b) delivers the gated import caller and removes the braces chain."
